<section class="about-content">
  <h2>Why This Platform Exists</h2>
  <p>
    Mahakumbh attracts millions of devotees from across the country.
    Due to large crowds, first-time visitors, elderly people, and families
    often face difficulties in navigation, safety, and planning.
  </p>

  <p>
    This platform aims to provide structured information, personalized
    planning, and crowd-aware guidance using a simple and easy-to-use interface.
  </p>
</section>

